 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "The global blow-up map, its affine restrictions, and independence of the affine cover",
 "statement": "The constructed comparison is the unique isomorphism over $X$ restricting\nto the identity comparison on every common affine refinement.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-def-nagata-sketch-data/prop-nagata-global-blowup-cover-independent.md",
